# fd --ignore-file, gitignore format, anchored to the home folder. Applied ONLY when the
# focused workspace has no folder and the cmd-space search falls back to searching home
# (context/producers.py search_scope). Never read for a rooted workspace.
#
# The project roots are searched by the workspaces named after them, and together they hold
# 55,000 of home's 60,000 files (measured 2026-11-07): listing them here made every open of
# the search on `work` or `personal` take 1.8 s instead of about 0.5 s.
/clients/
/clients-inactive/
/projects/
/projects-inactive/
